{"id": "EUVD-2026-108284", "enisaUuid": "e07755ec-e8ae-3878-9f1b-6b178ae3398d", "description": "OpenBao before 2.6.4 and 2.7.x before 2.7.1 contains a flaw in its rate limit quota subsystem where role resolution fails for requests with form-encoded bodies or forwarded certificates, so quota rules scoped to backend-specific roles are not enforced. Valid callers can repeatedly issue tokens without consuming the configured role-based rate limit budget.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:34", "baseScore": 6.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/openbao/openbao/security/advisories/GHSA-5v22-543h-wg96", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openbao-before-2.6.4-and-2.7.0-before-2.7.1-role-based-rate-limit-quota-bypass-via-request-parsing"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115359", "GHSA-4pgx-x639-9642"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1382c9f3-e4bf-33f0-8171-adb79eb568fb", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.6.4"}, {"id": "62794737-3d8c-3c29-a49a-2fbdcfc9f1bb", "product": {"name": "openbao", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}, "product_version": "2.7.0 <2.7.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "02d94a9f-8142-3a08-b0f4-7316331a350e", "vendor": {"name": "openbao"}}], "isExploited": false}